  "question": {
    "text": "The curve passing through <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and having slope <math><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> also passes through"
